  "about": {
    "title": "About the Shining Legends set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: Shining Legends is a Sun & Moon expansion released on 6 October 2017. It has 78 cards: 73 in the main set and 5 secret rares. There are also 60 reverse holos.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 73 main set cards), the <b>Master set</b> (133 cards, adding the reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (all 138 cards, adding the 5 secret rares).",
      "This free checklist lets you tick off the cards you own, count spare copies for trading, see your progress by rarity and plan your binder pages. It works on phones and computers, even offline, and your collection stays on your device."
    ]
